OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F366A1785444468
OL,3,CMan set fire to childhood home after
OL,4,Cbelieving he had been cut out of will
OL,6,FA man who set fire to his childhood
OL,7,Fhome after wrongly believing he had
OL,8,Fbeen cut out of his father's will, has
OL,9,Fbeen jailed.
OL,11,FDarren Davies, 55, poured petrol
OL,12,Faround his home before setting it
OL,13,Falright - causing an explosion - at
OL,14,Fthe #260,000 bungalow he shared with
OL,15,Fhis brother, Craig, in Lancashire,
OL,16,Fdestroying decades of family memories.
OL,18,FThe incident at the property on Carr
OL,19,FLane in Hambleton, near Poulton-le-
OL,20,FFylde followed the death of their
OL,21,Fparents in 2024.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/9
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
