OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,367,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36602
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F366A1785444468
OL,3,CMan set fire to childhood home after
OL,4,Cbelieving he had been cut out of will
OL,6,FPreston Crown Court heard that Davies
OL,7,Fset fire to the property on 27 March
OL,8,F2026 while gripped by the false belief
OL,9,Fof a "secret will" that he was not
OL,10,Fincluded in.
OL,12,FThe resulting blast sent glass and
OL,13,Fdebris flying, collapsing the roof and
OL,14,Fsending thick plumes of smoke into the
OL,15,Fsky, with neighbours describing a loud
OL,16,Fbang as emergency services rushed to
OL,17,Fthe scene.
OL,26,@qD@FOU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/9
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,367,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F366A1785444468
OL,3,CMan set fire to childhood home after
OL,4,Cbelieving he had been cut out of will
OL,6,FMiraculously uninjured, Davies emerged
OL,7,Ffrom the wreckage and reportedly told
OL,8,Fa passer-by, "My family want the
OL,9,Fhouse. If I can't have it, no-one can."
OL,11,FHe also told neighbours and police
OL,12,Fthat he had wanted to end his own life.
OL,14,FFirefighters brought the blaze under
OL,15,Fcontrol before it could spread
OL,16,Ffurther, discovering three gas
OL,17,Fcylinders placed in various rooms,
OL,18,Fpetrol in the loft, and a candle lit
OL,19,Fto start the fire.
OL,26,@pD@NOUqD@gO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/9
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
